17
00:00:52,990 --> 00:00:54,590
Force rice per person

18
00:00:54,590 --> 00:01:00,660
Can hold different things, but the total capacity cannot exceed

19
00:01:00,660 --> 00:01:03,860
We will have space to look for supplies later.

20
00:01:03,860 --> 00:01:05,620
thank you little miss

21
